How to properly build the project:
While you are in the root directory of the project issue following commands:

> mkdir build
> cd build
> cmake ..
> make

To build project in release mode and also builds libraries as shared call cmake with following options:
> cmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON ..

There should be brand new executable in the build directory.

You can also build only chosen module:
make decoder
make encoder
